aType\\\":\\\"html\\\",\\\"link\\\":null,\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003ePRIVACY POLICY\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCircuits Global Solutions Limited is a company that operates a transactional video-on-demand service dedicated to African content and the global audience.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis Privacy Policy discloses the privacy practices for www.circuits.tv. This privacy notice applies to information collected by our website.\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe collect and process personal data in the course of your use of the Circuits and our website in accordance with the relevant terms of use.\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe may also collect personal data about individuals that interact with us, by using our app, website and services, you acknowledge that we may process your personal data in accordance with this privacy policy.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eShould you have any questions or concerns relating to this privacy policy or your personal data, you can contact us at contact details provided at the end of this Privacy Policy.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eYOUR PERSONAL DATA THAT WE PROCESS\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIn connection with the services we provide, we collect personal information from you while you interact/use our products, services and website. We may ask you to provide us with certain personal data directly to contact or identify you, and some automatically for our Website to function effectively. We also collect personal data when you provide feedback and/or report a problem.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003ePURPOSE OF PROCESSING YOUR DATA\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur purpose for collecting your data include;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo administer our services\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo notify you of any changes to our services\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo send you service-related messages or emails\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo communicate with you and for customer support.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo address your inquiries, process your registration, and complete your transactions.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo fulfil our Know Your Customer (KYC) obligations.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo enforce our terms of service and any terms and conditions of any other agreements for our services.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo enhance data security\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo take statistical data and analytics for our use internally\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo analyze website usage and provide, maintain and improve the content and functionality of the website\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo provide a more seamless user experience on the website or apps.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo help us to develop, improve, customize or restructure our services\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eYOUR ACCESS AND RIGHT OVER INFORMATION\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYou have the right to control your personal data.\\u0026nbsp; Your rights include the right to;\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003erectify your personal information where you believe it to be inaccurate;\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ewhere feasible, receive all personal data you have provided to us in a structured, commonly used, and machine-readable format;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ewithdraw your consent to the processing of your personal data;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003erequest the erasure of your data\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYou may seek to exercise any of the above rights at any time by sending an email to us at: info@circuits.tv. \\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWHO WE SHARE YOUR DATA WITH\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe may share your data with third parties which may include: \\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eService Providers - We may share your personal data with service providers in order for them to provide services to us, such as payment processing service providers, or to conduct data processing on our behalf, or for data verification, centralisation, or logistics purposes.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLegal and Regulatory Authority - We may disclose your personal information if we believe it is reasonably necessary to comply with a law, regulation, order, subpoena, audit, or to protect any person's safety, or to address fraud, security, or technical issues.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIT/Financial Institution(s) - We collaborate with various IT/financial institutions to develop and market our products and services, and we may use this information to market-related products.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRETENTION OF YOUR DATA\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe data and any other information we collect from you will be stored for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes described in this Policy.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe will retain data subject to relevant provisions of applicable laws in order to resolve disputes, prevent fraud and abuse, and enforce our legal agreements and policies.\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eHOW YOUR DATA IS STORED\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe deploy reasonable and appropriate technical and organizational measures to keep your data safe. However, no data transmission over the internet or websites can be guaranteed to be secure from intrusion. Nevertheless, we are committed to doing our best to protect you.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe protect your data using physical, technical, and administrative security measures to reduce the risks of loss, misuse, unauthorized access, disclosure, and alteration.\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWhere there is an actual or suspected data breach capable of causing harm to your rights and freedoms, we will notify you without undue delay and use our best effort to remedy the breach promptly.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eINTERNATIONAL TRANSFER OF DATA\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIn providing our services, we may transfer your personal data outside our core operational area i.e Nigeria. Where transfer of data to a foreign country is necessary, your personal data shall only be transferred to foreign countries in which it has been determined in line with provisions of applicable laws, provide adequate levels of protection.\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCOOKIES\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe may collect information about your computer, including your IP address, operating system and browser type, for system administration and in order to create reports. This is statistical data about our users’ browsing actions and patterns, and does not identify any individual.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe only cookies in use on our site help Us understand how visitors engage and interact with our website and improve it through these reports.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLINKS\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur website may contain links to other sites. Users shall be aware that we are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of such other sites. We encourage Users to be aware when they leave our site and to read the privacy notices of any other site that collects personal data.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCONTACT AND CHANGES TO THIS POLICY\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIf you have any queries, requests or complaints on the subject of data protection or would like to opt out of any contact or communications, please do not hesitate to contact Us at \\u003ca href=\\\\\\\"mailto:info@circuits.tv\\\\\\\"\\u003einfo@circuits.tv\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe update our privacy policy from time to time. Kindly note that the use of our app or our website indicates your acceptance of the most recent version of our Privacy Policy. Visitors will know this by checking the last date of update on this page whenever you visit.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLast Updated:\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp; October 14th, 2024\\u003c/p\\u003e\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Terms and Conditions\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Read the terms guiding your experience on  (Circuits) Circuits TV, Africa’s leading global virtual cinema for Nollywood and other premium African entertainment, connecting audiences everywhere in the world.\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"terms_and_conditions\\\",\\\"mediaType\\\":\\\"html\\\",\\\"link\\\":null,\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eTERMS AND CONDITIONS\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e1. Introduction\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThese terms and conditions create an agreement between You (‘your’) and Circuits Global Solutions Limited (‘We’, ‘Us’) (the “Agreement”) concerning the use of Circuits, a transactional video-on-demand (TVOD) platform (‘The Service’) providing access to a wide range of content (‘Content����������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������