 we spotlight the best of African content, we will also be curating exceptional global entertainment, positioning Circuits as a one-stop destination for premium entertainment globally.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e2. How do I sign up for Circuits?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA: \\u003c/strong\\u003eSigning up for Circuits is quick and easy! You can register through our website, www.circuits.tv, or by downloading our mobile apps for Android and iOS.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e3. If I pay for 8 hours, can I watch any movie I like on the platform?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA: \\u003c/strong\\u003eNo, you can only watch the specific movie you paid for within the \\u003cstrong\\u003etimeframe you paid for\\u003c/strong\\u003e. However, you can watch that movie you paid for as many times as you like within the access period.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e4. How many hours of access do I get for my payment on Circuits?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA: \\u003c/strong\\u003eCircuits offers flexible viewing options to suit your needs. You can choose from the following access durations:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMovies: \\u003c/strong\\u003e8 hours, 12 hours, 24 hours, or 48 hours.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSeries: \\u003c/strong\\u003e5 days or 7 days.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eEach access option has a different price, so you can select what works best for you!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e5. Can I pay via bank transfer on the app?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA: \\u003c/strong\\u003ePayments made through the \\u003cstrong\\u003eCircuits app\\u003c/strong\\u003e can only be processed using cards linked to your \\u003cstrong\\u003eGoogle Play\\u003c/strong\\u003e or \\u003cstrong\\u003eApple iOS\\u003c/strong\\u003e account. However, in certain countries, bank transfer is available \\u003cstrong\\u003eonly through the Circuits website\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e6. Can I subscribe monthly on Circuits?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA: \\u003c/strong\\u003eNo, Circuits does not require a monthly subscription. We operate as a virtual cinema, allowing you to pay only for the movies, series or shows you want to watch, without the commitment of a monthly plan. That said, we are introducing a new option, which will allow users to pay for a curated bundle of content available to them over an extended period.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e7. If I pay for access via the website, can I watch on the app or on my TV?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA: \\u003c/strong\\u003eYes! Once you have paid for a title, you can watch it on \\u003cstrong\\u003eany compatible device\\u003c/strong\\u003e where Circuits is available, including our \\u003cstrong\\u003ewebsite, mobile app and all the major smart TVs\\u003c/strong\\u003e - as long as your access remains valid. Kindly refer to the banner on our website to see the list of smart TVs compatible with the Circuits app.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e8. I am using a promo code, but it is not working on the app. Why?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Promo codes \\u003cstrong\\u003edo not work on the app\\u003c/strong\\u003e; they can only be redeemed on the Circuits website. However, after redeeming a promo code on the website, you can watch the content on the \\u003cstrong\\u003eweb, on the app or on your TV,\\u003c/strong\\u003e provided it is a compatible device.\\u003cbr\\u003eTo check the list of \\u003cstrong\\u003ecompatible devices\\u003c/strong\\u003e, visit the banner section on our website, www.circuits.tv.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e9. Where do I input promo codes?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e You can redeem \\u003cstrong\\u003epromo codes\\u003c/strong\\u003e ONLY on the \\u003cstrong\\u003eCircuits���������������������� website\\u003c/strong\\u003e by following these steps:\\u003cbr\\u003e1. Select your preferred movie.\\u003cbr\\u003e2. Click \\u003cstrong\\u003eRent\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Choose your preferred access option (this is important. Make sure to select an access option/duration that your code is approved for to avoid being debited.\\u003cbr\\u003e4. Enter your \\u003cstrong\\u003epromo code\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\u003cbr\\u003e5. Click \\u003cstrong\\u003eComplete\\u003c/strong\\u003e to finalise your purchase.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e10. I created my account, but did not receive an activation code. What should I do?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA: \\u003c/strong\\u003eThis usually happens due to \\u003cstrong\\u003enetwork issues\\u003c/strong\\u003e. You can try the following:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Check your \\u003cstrong\\u003espam or junk folder\\u003c/strong\\u003e for the code.\\u003cbr\\u003e- \\u003cstrong\\u003eLog in using Google or Facebook\\u003c/strong\\u003e, which does not require an activation code.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e11. Can I pay via transfer?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e For users in \\u003cstrong\\u003eNigeria\\u003c/strong\\u003e and \\u003cstrong\\u003eGhana\\u003c/strong\\u003e, transfer payments are only available through the website using the \\u003cstrong\\u003eOpay transfer\\u003c/strong\\u003e option. Circuits also offers various payment methods, including \\u003cstrong\\u003edebit cards, USSD, and more\\u003c/strong\\u003e, depending on your location.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e12. My screen is blank after making a payment for a title. What should I do?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e If you are using an \\u003cstrong\\u003eincompatible device\\u003c/strong\\u003e (such as certain TVs), you might experience a blank screen. If you are using a compatible TV or if this issue is happening on your phone, try the following steps:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Update your device�������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������s operating system.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Restart the app and try again.\\u003cbr\\u003eIf the problem persists, contact our support team via \\u003cstrong\\u003einfo@circuits.tv\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e13. Why is my promo code not working for a preorder?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Preordered titles are \\u003cstrong\\u003ealready discounted\\u003c/strong\\u003e, so \\u003cstrong\\u003epromo codes cannot be applied to them\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e14. Circuits is not working on my TV. What should I do?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Please check the list of \\u003cstrong\\u003ecompatible television brands\\u003c/strong\\u003e on our website or app. We are continuously expanding our list of supported devices and will keep you updated on new additions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e15. Is Circuits only for Nigerians?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e No, Circuits is available to \\u003cstrong\\u003eentertainment lovers worldwide\\u003c/strong\\u003e. You can enjoy our content from \\u003cstrong\\u003eanywhere in the world!\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e16. I can�������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������t find foreign movies on Circuits. Why?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Circuits is dedicated to showcasing \\u003cstrong\\u003eAfrican content\\u003c/strong\\u003e, including \\u003cstrong\\u003efilms, series, comedy, and more\\u003c/strong\\u003e. We are constantly expanding our database to bring you the best African entertainment, and we are working on introducing the best foreign content.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e17. Is your payment only in Naira because I am abroad?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e No, Circuits supports \\u003cstrong\\u003emultiple currencies\\u003c/strong\\u003e. On the web, users see prices in their local currency based on their location; and on the app, users see the currency based on the location settings of their devices. For example, if you are in the U.S., you will see the price in USD on the website, and when using the app, prices will be displayed based on the location settings of your device.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e18. I am in the U.S., but I wanted to pay in Naira, and it is not accepting. Why?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e You cannot pay in Naira if you are outside Nigeria. You can only \\u003cstrong\\u003epay in the currency of your location\\u003c/strong\\u003e when using the Circuits.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e19. Can I download movies for offline viewing?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e No, Circuits does not currently offer offline viewing. You need an \\u003cstrong\\u003eactive internet connection\\u003c/strong\\u003e to stream content on the platform. We are working to make this download function available as soon as possible.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e20. What happens if I pause a movie within the access period?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Access on Circuits is counted from the time of purchase. You can pause and play within the access period, but access will expire after the number of hours purchased has elapsed from the time of purchase.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e21. I cannot seem to see some movies on the platform. Why?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Not all movies on Circuits are available globally. Some are available for certain locations only, but these limitations are for a few titles. You will see movies based on your location on the website and based on the location selected for your device while using the app.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e22. Do I need to have an account to watch a movie?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Yes, you need to have a Circuits account to watch a movie or series. You can sign up with any of our sign-up options.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e23. How many devices can use an account at a time?\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA: \\u003c/strong\\u003eYour Circuits account is limited to five devices at a time. Once the limit is reached, one device can be removed to make room for another device.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e24. I saw that you offer multiple prices and durations, but I can only see the highest price.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Please click the drop-down menu to see all our prices and access options on the website or the app.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e25. How do I change or select subtitles on Circuits?\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e All movies on Circuits are subtitled in various languages. To select a particular subtitle, please select the settings icon on the video player, click the Subtitles setting, and select your preferred language for subtitles.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e26. \\u0026nbsp;How do I share a complaint about my Circuits account?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eA:\\u003c/strong\\u003e We are happy to assist you with any issues or concerns. You can contact us through:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eEmail:\\u003c/strong\\u003e info@circuits.tv\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSocial Media:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Reach out to us on any of our official social media pages.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eInstagram:\\u003c/strong\\u003e @circuitstreams @circuitshelp_\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eFacebook:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Circuitsstreams\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eTiktok:\\u003c/strong\\u003e @circuitstreams_\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eX(Formerly Twitter):\\u003c/strong\\u003e @Circuitstreams_\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLinkedIn:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Circuits\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe hope this FAQ helps you navigate Circuits smoothly! Enjoy your virtual cinema experience. ������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refund Policy\\\",\\\"description\\\":null,\\\"type\\\":\\\"legal_notices\\\",\\\"mediaType\\\":\\\"html\\\",\\\"link\\\":null,\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\u003cp\\u003eEffective Date: December 24th, 2024\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAt Circuits, we strive to provide the best possible viewing experience for our customers. Please read our refund policy carefully before making any transactions on our platform.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e1.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cstrong\\u003eEligibility for Refunds\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eRefunds are only considered under the following conditions:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ea. The content purchased or rented was inaccessible due to technical issues caused by the platform, and reasonable troubleshooting efforts failed.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eb. The content was corrupted or of proven substandard quality, making it unwatchable. Substandard quality would be defined broken video content, incoherent subtitles and/or unclear audio.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e2.\\u003cstrong\\u003e Non-Refundable Situations\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eRefunds will not be issued in the following cases:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ea. The user is dissatisfied with the content (e.g., storyline, actors, or production quality).\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eb.The content was accessed or streamed successfully without lasting interruptions caused by the platform. Lasting interruptions shall be interruptions which persist for over two hours for movies and ten hours for series.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ec. Issues caused by the user's device, internet connection, payment card details or third-party services.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ed. Customer����������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������s preference for unsupported devices.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e3.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cstrong\\u003eTimeframe for Requesting Refunds\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eRefund requests must be submitted within twelve hours of the transaction or discovery of the issue.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e4.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cstrong\\u003eHow to Request a Refund\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo request a refund, contact our customer support team at\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cstrong\\u003einfo@circuits.tv\\u003c/strong\\u003e, providing the following details:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ea. Your name and registered email address.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eb. The transaction ID or receipt of the purchase.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u00